        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>JAIL DICE: Roll to Break</strong></i> is an <strong>Extraction Dice Action</strong> <strong>Game</strong> that blends <strong>Real-time Combat</strong> and <strong>Turn-based Progression</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579010/extras/3bc981dc9e4069caeb4911a33d37f47f.poster.avif?t=1784026070\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579010/extras/3bc981dc9e4069caeb4911a33d37f47f.webm?t=1784026070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579010/extras/3bc981dc9e4069caeb4911a33d37f47f.mp4?t=1784026070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot the dice-shaped combat machine, <strong>[ Dice-Rover ]</strong>, to destroy attacking objects and collect resources in the underground lab's combat zones. You won't be able to stay in the combat zones for long, as more threatening objects will continuously spawn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579010/extras/e0da839f0f8d553d4f05c54efa4a3c42.poster.avif?t=1784026070\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579010/extras/e0da839f0f8d553d4f05c54efa4a3c42.webm?t=1784026070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579010/extras/e0da839f0f8d553d4f05c54efa4a3c42.mp4?t=1784026070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To escape the combat zone and move to the maintenance room, you must acquire all <strong>[ 6 Golden Jewels ]</strong>. You'll need to wisely decide whether to keep collecting resources in the combat zone or gather the keys and escape to the maintenance room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579010/extras/a22c53fa97124c22a8228671a417e744.poster.avif?t=1784026070\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579010/extras/a22c53fa97124c22a8228671a417e744.webm?t=1784026070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579010/extras/a22c53fa97124c22a8228671a417e744.mp4?t=1784026070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you safely return to the maintenance room, activate <strong>New Abilities</strong> for your Dice-Rover with the collected resources. Each ability activation significantly changes the combat dynamic, and you can also uncover clues about <strong>[ JAIL DICE ]</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579010/extras/55dbc83b5713b354d6d5efe42f6dfb4f.poster.avif?t=1784026070\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579010/extras/55dbc83b5713b354d6d5efe42f6dfb4f.webm?t=1784026070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579010/extras/55dbc83b5713b354d6d5efe42f6dfb4f.mp4?t=1784026070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repeatedly move between combat zones and the maintenance room to strengthen your Dice-Rover. When it's powerful enough, <strong>Find and Destroy the Ultimate Target [ JAIL DICE ]</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579010/extras/4ce8482343ba11130af59fe74f63e4ec.poster.avif?t=1784026070\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579010/extras/4ce8482343ba11130af59fe74f63e4ec.webm?t=1784026070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579010/extras/4ce8482343ba11130af59fe74f63e4ec.mp4?t=1784026070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>JAIL DICE: Roll to Break</strong></i> is an <strong>Extraction Dice Action</strong> <strong>Game</strong> that blends <strong>Real-time Combat</strong> and <strong>Turn-based Progression</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579010/extras/3bc981dc9e4069caeb4911a33d37f47f.poster.avif?t=1784026070\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579010/extras/3bc981dc9e4069caeb4911a33d37f47f.webm?t=1784026070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579010/extras/3bc981dc9e4069caeb4911a33d37f47f.mp4?t=1784026070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot the dice-shaped combat machine, <strong>[ Dice-Rover ]</strong>, to destroy attacking objects and collect resources in the underground lab's combat zones. You won't be able to stay in the combat zones for long, as more threatening objects will continuously spawn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579010/extras/e0da839f0f8d553d4f05c54efa4a3c42.poster.avif?t=1784026070\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579010/extras/e0da839f0f8d553d4f05c54efa4a3c42.webm?t=1784026070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579010/extras/e0da839f0f8d553d4f05c54efa4a3c42.mp4?t=1784026070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To escape the combat zone and move to the maintenance room, you must acquire all <strong>[ 6 Golden Jewels ]</strong>. You'll need to wisely decide whether to keep collecting resources in the combat zone or gather the keys and escape to the maintenance room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579010/extras/a22c53fa97124c22a8228671a417e744.poster.avif?t=1784026070\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579010/extras/a22c53fa97124c22a8228671a417e744.webm?t=1784026070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579010/extras/a22c53fa97124c22a8228671a417e744.mp4?t=1784026070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you safely return to the maintenance room, activate <strong>New Abilities</strong> for your Dice-Rover with the collected resources. Each ability activation significantly changes the combat dynamic, and you can also uncover clues about <strong>[ JAIL DICE ]</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579010/extras/55dbc83b5713b354d6d5efe42f6dfb4f.poster.avif?t=1784026070\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579010/extras/55dbc83b5713b354d6d5efe42f6dfb4f.webm?t=1784026070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579010/extras/55dbc83b5713b354d6d5efe42f6dfb4f.mp4?t=1784026070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repeatedly move between combat zones and the maintenance room to strengthen your Dice-Rover. When it's powerful enough, <strong>Find and Destroy the Ultimate Target [ JAIL DICE ]</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579010/extras/4ce8482343ba11130af59fe74f63e4ec.poster.avif?t=1784026070\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579010/extras/4ce8482343ba11130af59fe74f63e4ec.webm?t=1784026070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579010/extras/4ce8482343ba11130af59fe74f63e4ec.mp4?t=1784026070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
